{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"secret","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A worker can push changes and submit an accepted result after the coordinator fails to load the privacy list, potentially exposing private data that the check would have blocked."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Stopping a worker while its changed-commit report retries against an unavailable coordinator leaves shutdown waiting until the attempt deadline."}]}